# SysEdit: the active child maximised (its system menu and restore button go into the frame's menu
# bar, the frame caption reads "System Configuration Editor - [C:\AUTOEXEC.BAT]"), the Window menu
# while maximised, child 1 chosen (it takes over the maximised state), Alt then '-' (WM_MENUCHAR:
# the bar's child system menu opens), Next (the next child maximised), then Restore
# reference: scn/mdi-max.scn (frames 02-07)
# regress: sh apps/sysedit/tests/sysedit.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: mdi-max/02.png 02.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-max/03.png 03.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-max/04.png 04.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-max/05.png 05.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-max/06.png 06.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-max/07.png 07.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
sleep 500
key alt
key minus
key x
sleep 300
shot shots/02.png
key alt
key w
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/03.png
key 1
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/04.png
key alt
key minus
sleep 300
shot shots/05.png
key t
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/06.png
key alt
key minus
key r
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/07.png
quit
